<title>CANADA: Onex says share of sale is C$58.4 million.</title>
<headline>Onex says share of sale is C$58.4 million.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Onex Corp said on Thursday that the company would receive C$58.4 million in net proceeds from the completion of the sale of Imperial Parking Limited to First Union Real Estate Investments.</p>
<p>The deal, worth C$105 million in total, was announced last month.</p>
<p>Onex's share of the proceeds was almost double the company's net investment of C$31 million, the company said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8104))</p>
</text>
